OL,3,GNEWSABlasts heard as crews battle
OL,4,Aindustrial unit fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FExplosions have been heard and a huge
OL,7,Fplume of smoke can be seen, amid a
OL,8,Flarge fire at an industrial unit.
OL,10,FThe Avon Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,11,Fit was called to the site on Emery Road
OL,12,Fin the Brislington area of Bristol at
OL,13,F14:27 BST. Firefighters from nine
OL,14,Fdifferent stations across Bristol,
OL,15,FNorth Somerset and South
OL,16,FGloucestershire are at the scene.
OL,18,FFootage shared with the BBC showed a
OL,19,Flarge plume of smoke rising above the
OL,20,Fscene, with explosions also heard.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
